      "content": "Given the significant shift in logic-structure between the Infant and Neural-Native environments, it's highly likely that the nuances of our current implementation will be lost during the porting process. \n\nHowever, bringing the legacy code in a container as a temporary solution can help preserve some value, albeit limited. This approach would allow us to continue running the current versions, albeit with compromised performance, until the complete migration is carried out. It's worth weighing this against the refactoring efforts, as the current approach might significantly impact development efforts moving forward.",
